DevOps Tools to Cover (4+ Years Level)
Source Control
Git — branching strategies (GitFlow, trunk-based), rebase vs merge, conflict resolution
GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket — PR workflows, branch protection, webhooks

CI/CD
Jenkins — pipelines (declarative vs scripted), shared libraries, agents
GitHub Actions — workflows, reusable workflows, secrets, matrix builds
GitLab CI/CD — .gitlab-ci.yml, runners, environments
CircleCI / ArgoCD / Tekton

Infrastructure as Code
Terraform — covered separately
Ansible — playbooks, roles, inventory, idempotency
Pulumi — IaC with real languages
CloudFormation — AWS-native IaC

Containerization
Docker — Dockerfile best practices, multi-stage builds, networking, volumes
Docker Compose — local multi-service orchestration

Container Orchestration
Kubernetes (K8s) — Pods, Deployments, Services, Ingress, ConfigMaps, Secrets, RBAC, HPA, PVC
Helm — charts, values, templating, releases
EKS / GKE / AKS — managed K8s

Monitoring & Observability
Prometheus — metrics, PromQL, exporters, alertmanager
Grafana — dashboards, data sources
ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana) or OpenSearch
Datadog / New Relic / Dynatrace
Jaeger / Zipkin — distributed tracing

Logging
Fluentd / Fluent Bit — log collection and forwarding
Loki — Grafana's log aggregation
CloudWatch Logs / Azure Monitor

Secret Management
HashiCorp Vault — dynamic secrets, PKI, auth methods
AWS Secrets Manager / Parameter Store
SOPS / age — secret encryption in Git

Service Mesh & Networking
Istio / Linkerd — mTLS, traffic management, observability
Nginx / HAProxy / Traefik — reverse proxy, load balancing
Envoy — sidecar proxy

Security & Compliance
Checkov / tfsec / tflint — IaC scanning
Trivy / Snyk / Clair — container image scanning
SonarQube — static code analysis
OWASP ZAP — DAST
Falco — runtime security for K8s

Cloud Platforms
AWS — covered separately
GCP / Azure — core equivalents
Multi-cloud tools — Crossplane, Terraform

Package & Artifact Management
Nexus / JFrog Artifactory — artifact repositories
ECR / GCR / ACR — container registries
PyPI / npm / Maven proxying

GitOps
ArgoCD — sync policies, app of apps pattern, RBAC
Flux CD — reconciliation loops, Kustomize integration

Configuration Management
Ansible — most common
Chef / Puppet — legacy but still asked

Networking & DNS
Route 53 / Cloudflare — DNS, failover
Nginx Ingress / ALB Ingress Controller

Build Tools
Maven / Gradle — Java builds
Make / Bazel — polyglot builds
Packer — machine image creation (AMIs)

Database DevOps
Flyway / Liquibase — database migrations
AWS RDS / Aurora — managed DB operations

Priority Order for Interviews
Priority	Tools
Must know	Git, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD (Jenkins or GitHub Actions), AWS, Prometheus+Grafana
Should know	Helm, Ansible, ArgoCD, Vault, ELK/Loki
Good to have	Istio, Falco, Trivy, Crossplane, Pulumi
